description = "[PAWN_nameDef] and [PAWN_possessive] fans set out as a space pirate crew. [PAWN_pronoun] raided corporations for money and staged performances to spread [PAWN_possessive] name.\n\n[PAWN_nameDef] became afraid of fire when a rival burned [PAWN_possessive] stage down. [PAWN_pronoun] relied on [PAWN_possessive] fans to do the work [PAWN_pronoun] found unappealing."
